---
import Base from '@/layouts/Base.astro';

const title = 'Privacy — Sorted';
const description = "What data we collect, what we do with it, and what we don't. Plain-language privacy policy from Sorted.";
---

<Base title={title} description={description}>
<section class="subhero dotgrid">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="crumbs"><a href="/">Sorted</a><span class="sep"></span><span>Legal</span><span class="sep"></span><span>Privacy</span></div>
    <span class="subhero-eyebrow">Legal · Privacy</span>
    <h1><span class="hl">Privacy</span> policy.</h1>
    <p class="subhero-sub">Plain English. No "we may share data with affiliates" weasel-wording. Last updated <strong>September 2026</strong>.</p>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section reveal"><div class="container">
    <div class="prose">
      <h2>The TL;DR.</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>What we collect:</strong> the minimum needed to verify you (name, date of birth, ID), let you transact (phone, email, transactions), and stay legal (AUSTRAC reporting).</li>
        <li><strong>What we sell:</strong> nothing. We don't sell, rent or trade your data. Not now, not ever.</li>
        <li><strong>Who we share with:</strong> the AUDD issuer (AUDC Pty Ltd), our identity-verification provider, our wallet provider, our cloud infrastructure, and law enforcement when legally required. That's it.</li>
        <li><strong>Where it lives:</strong> Australian data centres (Sydney). Encrypted at rest and in transit.</li>
        <li><strong>How long we keep it:</strong> only as long as legally required (seven years for transaction records, per AUSTRAC). After that, deleted.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>The longer answer.</h2>
      <h3>What we collect at signup</h3>
      <p>Phone number, email, full legal name, date of birth, residential address, and one form of government photo ID (driver's licence or passport). This is the legal minimum for AUSTRAC-regulated services in Australia. Identity documents are verified by a third-party provider (Frankie One); we keep a reference to the verification result, not the document itself.</p>
      <h3>What we collect during use</h3>
      <p>Every transaction (sender, recipient, amount, time), device info (model, OS, app version), and sign-in activity. We use this to spot fraud, comply with regulation, and improve the product.</p>
      <h3>What we never collect</h3>
      <p>Browsing history outside the app, location beyond country level, your contacts (unless you explicitly grant access for handle search), photos, microphone, or anything not directly related to the app working.</p>
      <h3>On the blockchain</h3>
      <p>Solana is a public ledger. Anyone can see that one wallet sent AUDD to another, including the amount. Your @handle and identity are not on-chain; the link between your identity and your wallet stays inside Sorted unless you choose to share it.</p>
      <h3>Cookies and tracking on this website</h3>
      <p>This marketing site sets no cookies and runs no third-party analytics or ad pixels. If you claim a handle or send us a message, we store what you typed plus your IP address and browser string so we can spot abuse.</p>
      <h3>Your rights</h3>
      <p>Under the Australian Privacy Principles you can:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Request a copy of the data we hold on you by emailing <a href="mailto:privacy@paymentsorted.com">privacy@paymentsorted.com</a></li>
        <li>Correct inaccurate data</li>
        <li>Request deletion (subject to AUSTRAC retention requirements for transaction records)</li>
        <li>Lodge a complaint with the OAIC if we get this wrong</li>
      </ul>
      <h3>Changes to this policy</h3>
      <p>We'll notify users in-app and by email at least 30 days before any material change.</p>
    </div></div></section>
<section class="page-cta">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="page-cta-inner reveal">
      <h2 class="page-cta-title">Questions about your data?</h2>
      <p class="page-cta-sub">Email <strong>privacy@paymentsorted.com</strong>. A real person, usually within a business day.</p>
      <div class="page-cta-actions">
        <a href="mailto:privacy@paymentsorted.com" class="btn btn-dark btn-lg">Email privacy <svg class="icon"><use href="#i-arrow-up-right"/></svg></a>
        <a href="/terms" class="btn btn-secondary btn-lg">Read the terms</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
</Base>
